+package endpoint
+
+// Tests for wave5/impossible-types.md: the states the redesign removes
+// either no longer compile (TestBadStatesDoNotCompile) or no longer get
+// past decode (TestDecodeRejects*), and the one place state is built is
+// table.go (TestOnlyTableGoBuildsState).
+
